| Step | Stories that can be built at the same time |
| --- | --- |
| 1 | Local relics |
| 2 | Shared relics, Relic index |
| 3 | Links to tasks |
| 4 | Benchmarks and limits, Agents use relics |
| 5 | Project schemas, Links between relics, History and diffs, Retiring and compaction |
| 6 | Default spec and plan schemas, Relics on the web |
| 7 | Automatic merging, then Merging for task descriptions |

- Relics created before story 7 name no schema. They stay valid under the open built-in rules until someone migrates them.
- Links made before story 8 accept any relationship name. Story 8 starts checking the name against the default list and the project's schema.
- Comments and attachments on relics have no story. That is decided once people are using relics.
- The exploration story is finished now that this page is approved and the stories exist.
